reduces waste up to 30% -> /", "Materials: carbon steel, stainless steel, super duplex, copper nickel, aluminum -> /about-us", "Industries: offshore, marine, process piping -> /about-us", "ISO 9001 certification achieved 2012 -> /about-us", "Company philosophy: Innovation Over Imitation, Excellence Without Exception, Louisiana Pride -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "custom fabrication", "founded_year": "2010", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='gulfside-fabricators' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Gusti Restaurant Equipment operates from a 30,000-square-foot showroom and warehouse on Dabney Road in Richmond, Virginia. The family-owned business has served the Richmond area for more than 25 years, with owner Joe Gusti and his family running day-to-day operations.

The firm stocks a broad range of front-of-house and back-of-house products, including three-compartment and two-compartment sinks, new restaurant equipment, restaurant furniture, smallwares, and outdoor cooking gear. The large showroom enables hands-on evaluation, and staff provide guidance on kitchen layout and equipment selection.

Customers span independent restaurants, small businesses, hotels, churches, and home cooks. The store is open to the public, and testimonials highlight its role in helping new ventures launch and existing operations expand. Clients range from first-time buyers outfitting a home kitchen to multi-unit operators seeking detailed specifications and printed product data.

