"Projects include structural steel packages for large-scale commercial developments and custom fabrications -> /about", "Serves clients throughout Indiana and across the United States -> /about", "Emphasizes clear communication, dependable scheduling, accountability from bid through delivery -> /about", "Differentiation: building relationships, solving problems, keeping steel on critical path -> /about", "Team includes Lawrence Casey with 17 years experience in welding, steel fabrication, project execution -> /about", "Patrick Bissonnette manages structural and miscellaneous steel projects -> /about", "Sean Collins supports estimating department -> /about", "Amber Hogue manages administrative operations -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "HG Metals is a leading structural and miscellaneous steel fabrication company based in Indianapolis, Indiana.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/hg-metals/"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='hg-metals' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='High Pine Custom Apparel operates from Standish, Maine, at 320 Ossipee Trail West. The founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed, and the founders are not named on the company''s website. The business presents itself as a Maine-made custom apparel brand offering a range of decoration services.

The shop provides manual screen printing, embroidery with in-house digitizing (including 3D puff and appliqué options), transfer printing for full-color designs, and graphic design services covering logos and brand development. It also produces stickers and custom apparel. The company describes its screen printing as using durable inks and meticulously maintained screens for sharp artwork, and notes it handles orders from small batches to large runs. Embroidery is offered from a few hats to full workwear runs.

