UPDATE companies SET description='Haas & Sons Electric operates from Millersville, Maryland, as a family-owned and operated electrical contracting business.

The firm provides a full range of residential and commercial electrical services across Anne Arundel County and surrounding areas. Its scope covers electrical repairs, lighting and fixture installation, heavy-up panel upgrades and fuse-box conversions, outlet and switch work, troubleshooting and diagnostics, energy-efficiency maintenance, and specialty systems such as EV charger installation, generator hookups, landscape and security lighting, and home automation.

The company emphasizes upfront pricing, on-time arrival, and a clean-worksite policy that includes boot covers and thorough cleanup. It holds BBB accreditation with an A+ rating, follows OSHA-compliant safety practices, and employs factory-trained, licensed electricians. Recognition includes a 2019 Pasadena Voice Readers'' Choice award (#2 Best Electrical Contractor), Expertise.com "17 Best Washington DC Electricians," BuildZoom top 1% of Maryland licensed contractors, Angi Approved status, Best of Houzz (2018, 2019), and Nextdoor Neighborhood Favorite (2021–2024).', certifications=ARRAY['BBB Accredited Business (A+ rating)','OSHA compliant practices','Maryland licensed electrical contractor']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electrical repairs and troubleshooting", "Lighting design and fixture installation (recessed, LED, landscape, security)", "Heavy-up panel upgrades and fuse-box conversions", "Aluminum wiring replacement and knob-and-tube remediation", "Outlet and switch installation, relocation, and repair", "EV charger (Level 2) installation", "Generator installation and transfer-switch wiring", "Home automation and smart-device wiring", "Ceiling fan installation", "Circuit breaker and subpanel installation", "Energy-efficiency maintenance and inspections", "Commercial electrician services", "Residential electrical remodeling and additions"], "industries": ["Residential electrical services", "Commercial electrical services", "Home automation and smart home", "Electric vehicle charging infrastructure", "Energy efficiency and auditing"], "materials": ["Aluminum wiring (remediation)", "Copper wiring", "AFCI/GFCI breakers", "Surge protectors", "Dimmer switches", "LED lighting fixtures"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day service for emergencies; standard calls scheduled promptly", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Location: Millersville, Maryland -> db", "Family-owned and operated -> / (homepage)", "Over 26 years combined ex