Haf serves industries such as food processing (dairy, bakery, snacks, pet food, nutraceuticals), plastics, rubber, chemical, pharmaceuticals, ceramics, steel, air pollution control, and batteries.

The company differentiates itself through operator-centric designs and a quality control process that inspects every piece of equipment before shipment. Its "HAF Difference" values emphasize team focus, humble confidence, elite performance, hustle, and driven-yet-fun culture. In 2024, Haf acquired the assets of Semi Bulk Systems to expand its product lines into both dry and liquid ingredient handling.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["System Integration", "Batching", "Unloading", "Packaging", "Controls", "Pneumatic Conveying (Vacuum Dilute Phase)", "Pneumatic Conveying (Vacuum Dense Phase)", "Pneumatic Conveying (Pressure Dilute Phase)", "Pneumatic Conveying (Pressure Dense Phase)", "Truck and Railcar Unloading", "Mechanical Conveying (Bucket Elevator)", "Mechanical Conveying (Screw Conveyor)", "Mechanical Conveying (Incline Flex Auger)", "Pneumatic Blending", "Bulk Bag Unloading (Low Head Height, Forklift Type, Hoist and Trolley)", "Feeding (Volumetric Tube Feeder, Loss-in-Weight Feeder, Gravimetric Enrobing Feeder)", "Air Pollution Control", "Filter Receivers (Horizontal Load, Compact Horizontal Load, Loss-in-Weight Receiver)", "Dust Collection (Dry Dust Collector, Wet Dust Collector, Portable Dust Collector, In-line HEPA Filter)", "Vertical Mix Dryer", "Gravity Divert Valve", "Process Bin Activator", "Liquid Handling (Liquid Tank Assembly, Liquid Tote Assembly)", "Parts and Service", "Vacuum Service"], "industries": ["Plastic", "Dairy", "Foods", "Rubber", "Air Pollution Control", "Nutraceuticals", "Pet Food", "Chemical", "Bakery", "Steel", "Snacks", "Ceramics", "Pharmaceuticals", "Batteries"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Moovinator", "Jango", "Navigator", "Jet Mixer", "H-Series", "M-Series", "Horizontal Load Filter Receiver", "Top Load Filter Receiver", "Bulk Bag Unloader", "Bag Break Station", "Nesting Bulk Bag Unloader", "Volumetric Tube Feeder", "Loss-in-Weight Feeder", "Gravimetric Enrobing Feeder", "Dry Dust Collector", "Wet D