UPDATE companies SET description='Hanley''s Foods is based in Baton Rouge, Louisiana. The company was founded in 2010 by Richard and Kate Hanley, a couple who have been together since high school. The business originated in 2012 when the pair discovered their favorite restaurant-style dressing, Sensation®, was unavailable in stores. After testing recipes at salad parties with family and friends, they launched the winning formula at the Red Stick Farmers Market, where it sold out repeatedly. They later partnered with the LSU AgCenter''s Food Incubator to scale production.

The company manufactures premium salad dressings and croutons, producing every bottle from scratch in its Louisiana facility. Hanley''s focuses exclusively on these two product lines, using natural, locally sourced ingredients. Its products are now stocked in more than 2,000 retail locations across the United States.

Hanley''s serves the retail grocery and foodservice sectors. Its customer base includes national chains such as Walmart, Costco, Whole Foods Market, and Winn-Dixie, as well as regional grocers like Rouses Markets and AG Stores. The company also supplies foodservice operators including Compass Group and Royal Caribbean.

The founders started Hanley''s to bring a beloved local dressing to the broader market. The company emphasizes a single-minded commitment to quality, citing certifications such as HACCP, NSF, SQF, and GMP, and a philosophy of using premium, natural ingredients sourced from south Louisiana.', certifications=ARRAY['HACCP','NSF','SQF','SOP','SSOP','GMP','CCP','CAP']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Salad dressing manufacturing", "Crouton manufacturing"], "industries": ["Retail", "Foodservice", "Hospitality"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Single-focus on dressings and croutons made from scratch in Louisiana", "Premium, natural, locally sourced ingredients", "Certified to HACCP, NSF, SQF, GMP, and other food safety standards", "Distribution in over 2,000 retail stores nationwide", "Featured in Forbes and on The Billion Dollar Buyer"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2010 -> db", "Founders Richard and Kate Hanley -> /about", "Originated in 2012 -> /about", "Headquartered in Baton Rouge, Louisiana -> db", "Manufactures salad dressings and croutons -> db, /about", "Produces every bottle from scratch in Louisiana -> /about", "Over 2,000 retail stores nationwide -> /about", "Certifications: HACCP, NSF, SQF, SOP, SSOP, GMP, CCP, CAP -> /about", "Trusted retailers: Walmart, Costco, Whole Foods, Compass Group, Royal Caribbean, etc. -> /about", "Single-focus on dressings and croutons -> /about", "Premium, natural, locally sourced ingredients -> /about", "Featured in Forbes and The Billion Dollar Buyer -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Now, Hanley''s is in over 2000 retail stores throughout the US, making every bottle in Louisiana from scratch.", "founded_year": "2010", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='hanley-s-foods' A