UPDATE companies SET description='The company focuses on tight-tolerance plastic insert molding and injection molding, including over molding and insert molding with aluminum inserts, plastic fasteners, threaded brass, and knurled inserts. It also provides value-added light assembly services such as sonic welding, plastic joining, O-ring installation, and manual box-build assembly. Biopolymer molding is offered for environmentally friendly applications. The facility handles production volumes ranging from a few thousand pieces per year to several million.

