UPDATE companies SET description='Illes Foods operates from Carrollton, Texas, drawing on nearly a century of experience in flavor development and food manufacturing. The company traces its roots back 97 years, built on values of integrity, curiosity, and partnership, though a specific founding year and founder names are not publicly disclosed.

The company produces custom seasonings, sauces, marinades, and beverage solutions, offering a full range of manufacturing services for both liquid and dry products. Its capabilities extend to custom flavor creation, flavor development, packaging, and labeling, serving as a single-source partner for product commercialization.

Illes Foods serves foodservice chains, food manufacturers, and grocery retailers. Testimonials from procurement, R&D, and culinary leaders highlight long-term partnerships spanning 3 to 15 years.

The company differentiates itself with a "small enough to care, big enough to execute" philosophy, emphasizing trust, transparency, and results. Its core values—operating with integrity, staying intentionally curious, and believing in the power of partnership—guide decisions, and the team aims to function as an extension of its customers'' own R&D and supply chain operations.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Seasonings", "Sauces", "Marinades", "Beverages", "Custom Flavor Creations", "Flavor Development", "Manufacturing services for liquid products", "Manufacturing services for dry products", "Packaging", "Labeling"], "industries": ["Foodservice", "Food Manufacturers", "Grocery Retailers"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Small enough to care, big enough to execute", "Trust, transparency and results with no excuses", "Full manufacturing services for liquid and dry products including packaging and labeling", "R&D and culinary expertise for flavor development and trend insights"], "facts_used": ["Location: Carrollton, Texas -> db", "97 years of history -> /", "Core values: integrity, curiosity, partnership -> /about", "Products: seasonings, sauces, marinades, beverages, custom flavor creations, flavor development -> db capabilities and /", "Manufacturing services for liquid and dry products, packaging, labeling -> /", "Industries served: foodservice chains, food manufacturers, grocery retailers -> db industries_served and /", "Differentiators: small enough to care, big enough to execute; trust, transparency, results -> /", "Testimonials from various industry roles -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We offer the full gamut of manufacturing services for liquid and dry products", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags":